{
  "name": "Track new SAM.gov contract opportunities in Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Track new SAM.gov contract opportunities in Google Sheets\n\n### Who it's for\nSmall federal contractors and BD teams who want a running pipeline sheet of SAM.gov opportunities.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Schedule** fires every morning at 7:00.\n2. **Run SAM.gov Opportunity Radar** calls the Apify Actor and returns only **new or amended** notices for your filters.\n3. **Has notice?** stops on empty days.\n4. **Pick columns** keeps 16 fields.\n5. **Append or update in Google Sheets** matches on `noticeId`, so amended notices update their row.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Get your Apify API token: Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations.\n2. In *Run SAM.gov Opportunity Radar*, create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`. Never paste the token into the URL or body.\n3. Connect your **Google Sheets** credential, paste your spreadsheet ID, and put the 16 column names from *Pick columns* in row 1.\n4. Run once manually, check the output, then activate.\n\n### Customize the input\nEdit the JSON body of *Run SAM.gov Opportunity Radar*: `naicsCodes`, `setAside`, `state`, `keywords`. Keep `monitorName` fixed.\n\n### Requirements\nApify, pay per result: $0.01 per run + $0.004 per new or changed notice. No SAM.gov API key needed.\nActor: https://apify.com/cce_partners/samgov-opportunity-radar\n\n### How to extend\nAdd a Slack/email alert after the sheet step, or filter on `responseDeadline`.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "56f56d4a-55d9-4583-8883-918aaa3a08dc",
      "name": "Overview and setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Schedule\nChange the cron/interval here. Runs once per period; the Actor itself skips anything already sent.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e29b94c4-104a-4062-9ae5-402a7e743b5e",
      "name": "Step 1: Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Run SAM.gov Opportunity Radar on Apify\nPOST to run-sync-get-dataset-items with your filters in the JSON body. Auth: your Header Auth credential (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`). Timeout 300 s.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "41d594ad-bd2d-4aeb-aabe-a341c222470f",
      "name": "Step 2: Run the Actor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Filter and deliver to Google Sheets\n*Has notice?* stops when there's nothing new. Then the results go to Google Sheets. Set your own credential and target (sheet ID / channel) on the last node.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1b43e32c-8bd5-4376-beab-fe3ea7bc4aef",
      "name": "Step 3: Deliver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
